{"4158000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SqueakOut", "steam_appid": 4158000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are nothing more than laboratory mice trapped inside the twisted experiments of a mad scientist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in online co-op with up to 4 players. Survive deadly trials, earn seeds, upgrade your shelter, and build the screwdriver you need to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't waste time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more unstable the laboratory becomes. Complete the screwdriver before the scientist's experiments spiral completely out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/aab735800aa65b76ad2c066f52a9cfc0.poster.avif?t=1782760734\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/aab735800aa65b76ad2c066f52a9cfc0.webm?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/aab735800aa65b76ad2c066f52a9cfc0.mp4?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge deadly traps, outsmart killer robots, complete dangerous trials, and unleash physics-driven chaos with weapons, gadgets, and explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/7c5fdd67a4bda28071d9ec425354cf77.poster.avif?t=1782760734\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/7c5fdd67a4bda28071d9ec425354cf77.webm?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/7c5fdd67a4bda28071d9ec425354cf77.mp4?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your shelter, unlock powerful equipment and contraptions, and work together to complete the screwdriver before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/e0e8c4abf69f0feac3a41f440255ecfe.poster.avif?t=1782760734\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/e0e8c4abf69f0feac3a41f440255ecfe.webm?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/e0e8c4abf69f0feac3a41f440255ecfe.mp4?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are nothing more than laboratory mice trapped inside the twisted experiments of a mad scientist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in online co-op with up to 4 players. Survive deadly trials, earn seeds, upgrade your shelter, and build the screwdriver you need to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't waste time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more unstable the laboratory becomes. Complete the screwdriver before the scientist's experiments spiral completely out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/aab735800aa65b76ad2c066f52a9cfc0.poster.avif?t=1782760734\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/aab735800aa65b76ad2c066f52a9cfc0.webm?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/aab735800aa65b76ad2c066f52a9cfc0.mp4?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge deadly traps, outsmart killer robots, complete dangerous trials, and unleash physics-driven chaos with weapons, gadgets, and explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/7c5fdd67a4bda28071d9ec425354cf77.poster.avif?t=1782760734\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/7c5fdd67a4bda28071d9ec425354cf77.webm?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/7c5fdd67a4bda28071d9ec425354cf77.mp4?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your shelter, unlock powerful equipment and contraptions, and work together to complete the screwdriver before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/e0e8c4abf69f0feac3a41f440255ecfe.poster.avif?t=1782760734\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158000/extras/e0e8c4abf69f0feac3a41f440255ecfe.webm?t=1782760734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.